return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:13+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:13+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Uza huduma ya upangishaji ya Zinn Digital® kutoka kwenye tovuti yako mwenyewe ya WordPress — upangishaji wa WordPress, WooCommerce, wakala, muuzaji tena, wingu na VPS. Tafuta na utoe vikoa kutoka kwenye akaunti yako ya muuzaji tena, waingize wateja wako moja kwa moja kwenye paneli yao ya upangishaji, na uandae upangishaji kiotomatiki wakati agizo la WooCommerce linapolipiwa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Jukwaa la upangishaji lilijibu kwa hali ya %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Tafuta jina la kikoa chako','Search'=>'Tafuta','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Hakuna viendelezi vilivyochunguzwa kwa jina hilo.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Utafutaji wa kikoa haupatikani kwenye tovuti hii kwa sasa.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Hatujaweza kufikia sajili ya kikoa sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'Ufunguo wa API haupo au si sahihi tena. Ukague chini ya Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Ufunguo huu wa API hauna ruhusa ya sites.view, ambayo inahitajika na utafutaji wa kikoa. Yaongeze kwenye ufunguo katika paneli yako ya muuzaji, au ufute ufunguo hapa ili kurudi kwenye utafutaji wa umma.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Wasimamizi pekee ndio wanaoona hili:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Hatuwezi kuangalia hii — jaribu tena','Already registered'=>'Imesajiliwa tayari','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Inapatikana — tuulize kuhusu bei','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Inapatikana — %1$s %2$s kwa mwaka wa kwanza','Register it'=>'Isajili','Manage my hosting'=>'Dhibiti upangishaji wangu','Please sign in first.'=>'Tafadhali ingia kwanza.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Akaunti hii bado haijaunganishwa na huduma ya upangishaji.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Jukwaa la upangishaji halikurudisha kiungo cha kuingia.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zana za Muuzaji Mkuu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Features'=>'Vipengele','Styling'=>'Mtindo','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ruhusu mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Imezimwa: zana zilizo hapa chini na njia zao za REST hazijasajiliwa kabisa.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Akaunti yako ya muuzaji wa Zinn Digital®','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Unda ufunguo wa API wa muuzaji katika dashibodi yako ya Zinn® chini ya Msanidi Programu → Vifunguo vya API, na ubandike hapa.','Reseller API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API wa muuzaji','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Inahifadhiwa kwenye tovuti hii pekee, na haijumuishwi kamwe kwenye uhamishaji wa data au ripoti ya uchunguzi.','Plan to provision'=>'Mpango wa kutoa','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Msimbo wa mpango ambao wateja wapya wanapewa. Acha wazi ili kuulizwa kila wakati.','API address'=>'Anwani ya API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Acha hii jinsi ilivyo isipokuwa usaidizi wa Zinn® umekuomba uibadilishe.','Control-panel address'=>'Anwani ya jopo la udhibiti','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Mahali ambapo kiungo cha "Upangishaji wangu" huwapeleka wateja wako.','Domain search'=>'Utafutaji wa kikoa','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Weka msimbo mfupi wa [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Weka msimbo mfupi kwenye ukurasa wowote ili kuwaruhusu wageni kuangalia kikoa na kukinunua kupitia wewe.','Panel link'=>'Kiungo cha paneli','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Onyesha kiungo cha "Upangishaji wangu" kwa wateja walioingia','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Utoaji wa WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Andaa upangishaji kiotomatiki agizo la WooCommerce linapokamilika','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Huanza kutumika tu kwa maagizo yaliyo na bidhaa uliyoiunganisha na kifurushi cha Zinn®.','Domain search appearance'=>'Muonekano wa utafutaji wa kikoa','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Wijeti hii huonekana ndani ya mandhari yako mwenyewe. Chagua mpangilio wa awali, au weka rangi zako mwenyewe — kwa njia yoyote ile, hakuna kinachoongezwa kwenye kurasa zako ambacho mgeni anaweza kuona kuwa ni chetu.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Kila tabaka linalotumiwa na wijeti limeorodheshwa katika readme ya programu-jalizi, ili msanidi aweze kubatilisha chochote ambacho seti ya awali haikushughulikia.','Follow my theme'=>'Fuata mandhari yangu','Soft'=>'Laini','High contrast'=>'Utofautishaji wa juu','Compact'=>'Bana','Buy-link colour'=>'Rangi ya kiungo cha ununuzi','“Available” colour'=>'Rangi ya "Inapatikana"','“Could not check” colour'=>'Rangi ya "Haikuweza kuangaliwa"','Error colour'=>'Rangi ya hitilafu','Corner rounding'=>'Mviringo wa pembe','Space inside each row'=>'Nafasi ndani ya kila safu','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Domain-name weight'=>'Uzito wa jina la kikoa','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Bado hakuna ufunguo wa API wa muuzaji tena.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Utafutaji wa kikoa tayari unafanya kazi bila ufunguo, kwa bei za umma. Kiungo cha paneli na uandaaji wa WooCommerce unahitaji ufunguo: unda ufunguo kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® chini ya Msanidi Programu → Vifunguo vya API.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Fungua dashibodi yangu ya Zinn®','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'Ufunguo umewekwa, lakini hakuna chochote kilichowashwa.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Hakuna hata moja ya vipengele vitatu iliyowashwa, kwa hivyo programu-jalizi hii haifanyi chochote kwenye tovuti yako. Washa kile unachohitaji chini ya Vipengele.','Open Features'=>'Fungua Vipengele','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Tayari — kipengele %d kimewashwa.' . "\0" . 'Tayari — vipengele %d vimewashwa.','Selling from'=>'Inauza kutoka','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Bado hakuna ufunguo wa API, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichounganishwa.','Not connected: %s'=>'Haijaunganishwa: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Mpango wako wa muuzaji ni %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa API wa Zinn® uliosanidiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichoandaliwa.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Agizo hili halikujumuisha jina la kikoa, kwa hivyo hapakuwa na chochote cha kuandaa.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Jukwaa la upangishaji halikurudisha tovuti.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Upangishaji wa Zinn® umetolewa kwa ajili ya %1$s (huduma %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Jukwaa la upangishaji halikurudisha akaunti ya mteja.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Upangishaji wa Zinn® HAUJATAYARISHWA: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Mfululizo wa bidhaa za Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Msururu wa bidhaa za Zinn® utakaotolewa bidhaa hii itakaponunuliwa. Acha wazi ili kutumia chaguomsingi kutoka kwa mipangilio ya programu-jalizi.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Ukaribishaji wa Zinn®','Service id'=>'Kitambulisho cha huduma','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Hakuna kilichoandaliwa kwa agizo hili.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu mlalo','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu mlalo hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Copied'=>'Imenakiliwa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu-jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na ikiwa inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Weka upya kwa chaguomsingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii itarejesha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii hadi kwenye chaguomsingi yake. Je, ungependa kuendelea?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi wa utambuzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili ya mipangilio','Import'=>'Leta','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina manenosiri, tokeni au funguo za API kamwe — utahitaji kuziingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudishwa kwa chaguomsingi yake.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hilo halikuweza kusomwa. Chagua faili la mipangilio lililosafirishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa faili ya kuhamisha mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo si faili la uhamishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilihamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi tofauti (%s), kwa hivyo kuiingiza hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Nywila na funguo za API hazijumuishwi kamwe kwenye uhamishaji, kwa hivyo ziweke tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeagizwa. Manenosiri na funguo za API hazijumuishwi kwenye uhamishaji kamwe, kwa hivyo ziweke tena.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linalohitaji uangalizi','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inatumika kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatuwezi kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu-jalizi hii haikueleza sababu. Tuma ripoti ya utambuzi na tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho %s zilizopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(hufunguka kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho hasa kitakachotumwa — hakuna kingine, na hakuna kilichofichwa. Nywila, tokeni na funguo zako za API hazimo humo.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao wa kunakili','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tikiti ya usaidizi na kujibu kupitia barua pepe. Ikiwa ungependelea kutoituma, inakili hapo juu na uibandike mwenyewe kwenye tikiti.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatuwezi kufikia Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tiketi badala yake — hakuna kosa lolote kwenye mipangilio yako.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako — kumbukumbu %s — na utajibu kwa barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — ripoti za awali zilifika.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kukubali ripoti sasa hivi — hilo ni tatizo la upande wetu, si wako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Inakili hapo juu na ufungue tiketi, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Uhosti wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitishwa, vikoa na upangaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii ili kujipatia riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wataalamu huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizotayarishwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutoa zabuni.','Style preset'=>'Weka mapema ya mtindo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Sehemu ya kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinachukua nafasi yake.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na mpangilio wa awali utatumika jinsi ulivyo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama madokezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya kusasisha ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia ikiwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa kukaguliwa uadilifu wake na halijasakinishwa.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Kitendo hakikuweza kukamilika. Jaribu tena, na kikiendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na msimamizi wa tovuti.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Thamani inayohitajika haipo au ina muundo usio sahihi. Angalia muundo wa ingizo (input schema) wa uwezo huo.','The site refused the request.'=>'Tovuti imekataa ombi hilo.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Ruhusu wasaidizi wa AI kama vile Claude, Cursor au VS Code wakufanyie kazi kwenye tovuti hii kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress kwa nenosiri la programu na wanaweza tu kufanya kile ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au toleo jipya zaidi. Sasisha WordPress ili kuwatumia.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Anwani ya muunganisho (kikomo cha MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Unda nenosiri la programu kwa ajili ya mtumiaji wako','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ongeza hii kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, pamoja na jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: weka ingizo sawa chini ya "servers" katika .vscode/mcp.json, si chini ya "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Nyaraka za wasanidi programu: uwezo, REST na MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Dhibiti wateja wako wa upangishaji, mipango yao na tovuti zao kwenye Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa tovuti hii.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Wateja wako, mipango yao na tovuti zao, kupitia akaunti yako ya muuzaji ya Zinn Digital®.','Read your reseller account'=>'Soma akaunti yako ya muuzaji','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'Hurejesha akaunti yako ya muuzaji tena kwa usomaji mmoja: chapa, mipango, idadi ya wateja na huduma, na kile kilichowekwa.','List your clients'=>'Orodhesha wateja wako','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Huorodhesha akaunti za wateja wako, ukurasa mmoja kwa wakati mmoja (cursor, limit).','Create a client'=>'Unda mteja','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Inaunda akaunti ya mteja chini ya yako (name; default_currency, msimbo wa herufi tatu). Waweke kwenye mpango kabla ya tovuti yao ya kwanza.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Soma mpango wa mteja','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Hurejesha mpango ambao mteja anatumia na gharama yake kwako (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Weka mteja kwenye mpango','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Huweka mteja kwenye moja ya mipango yako (client_id, plan_code; interval: month au year). Fanya hivi kabla ya tovuti yao ya kwanza.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Orodhesha mipango unayoweza kuuza','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Huorodhesha mipango ya upangishaji na bei zake (product_line na currency huipunguza).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Orodhesha tovuti za wateja wako','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'Huorodhesha kila kitu ulichotoa kwa ajili ya wateja wako (client_id na status huipunguza), ukurasa mmoja kwa wakati mmoja.','Create a site for a client'=>'Tengeneza tovuti kwa ajili ya mteja','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Hutengeneza tovuti inayopangishwa kwa ajili ya mmoja wa wateja wako (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Inatozwa kwenye akaunti yako kulingana na mpango wa mteja, kama kutoka kwenye duka lako.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Simamisha tovuti ya mteja','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Huweka tovuti ya mteja kwenye usitishaji kwa sababu ya kutolipa (site_id; reason: dokezo lako mwenyewe, halionyeshwi mteja kamwe). Tovuti huacha kutoa huduma hadi kusimamishwa kwake kuondolewe.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Rejesha tovuti ya mteja iliyosimamishwa','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'Huondoa kizuizi cha kutolipa, ili tovuti ianze kufanya kazi tena (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya Zana za Muuzaji Mkuu','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Hurejesha mipangilio ya programu-jalizi hii (anwani ya API, mpango unaotumiwa na maagizo mapya, vipengele vilivyowashwa). Ufunguo wa API haurejeshwi kamwe, bali iwapo kuna uliowekwa akiba pekee.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya Reseller Toolkit','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Hubadilisha mipangilio unayotuma (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) na kuhifadhi iliyobaki. Ufunguo wa API na anwani hubadilishwa kwenye skrini pekee.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Kwanza ongeza ufunguo wako wa API ya muuzaji wa Zinn Digital® kwenye skrini ya Reseller Toolkit.']];